    # WAVE 36 — META-AMPLIFICATION: DYNAMIC BUDGET AND MAINSTREAM-SURPASS VECTOR
    # =============================================================================
    # This wave closes the feedback loop:
    #   1. Measures synergy and surpass index from Wave 35.
    #   2. Uses them to dynamically amplify the evolution budget (more power).
    #   3. Tracks a 7-dimensional "vs mainstream" surpass vector.
