    # -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
    # FINAL KNOWLEDGE REINDEX — every wave above mutates the libraries after the
    # first _build_knowledge_index() at ~line 32067. Rebuilding here (after all
    # growth settles) keeps retrieve_by_concept() and FreeThoughtEngine's concept
    # pool covering 100% of what the file actually holds. KNOWLEDGE_ANSWERS is
